Scope / 適用範圍

This license covers the work authored by df-haha in this repository.

- Plugins or files that ship their own license file keep that license
  (for example plugins/insane-review/LICENSE, plugins/pilotfish-roles/LICENSE.pilotfish,
  plugins/codex-image/vendor/LICENSE-imagegen.txt).
- Plugins credited to other authors or adapted from upstream projects in the
  README (for example deep-research-ryan, fact-check, df-graph, ruling-ledger)
  remain under their original authors' terms; this license does not relicense them.

